WEBVTT

00:00:26.356 --> 00:00:30.227
Many people spend years searching for
and developing their purposes,

00:00:30.260 --> 00:00:31.862
and some never find it.

00:00:31.862 --> 00:00:35.098
But typically we see responses like this:

00:00:35.132 --> 00:00:37.601
to be an engaged parent,

00:00:37.634 --> 00:00:40.671
to make meaningful change in my community,

00:00:40.704 --> 00:00:43.206
to build a career I'm proud of,

00:00:43.206 --> 00:00:45.809
to live for a long time,
just keeping it simple.

00:00:45.842 --> 00:00:48.912
But then there was the answer
of one young woman

00:00:48.946 --> 00:00:50.347
who I worked with.

00:00:50.347 --> 00:00:52.583
Before meeting with her, as I always did,

00:00:52.616 --> 00:00:55.485
I flipped to see
how she described her purpose.

00:00:55.519 --> 00:00:58.021
And she wrote this:

00:00:58.055 --> 00:01:01.191
"To avoid being noticed by other people."